{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Die, over and over.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164230/extras/7882bedf55e6e7ca36a2c43a2deaba91.poster.avif?t=1770287610\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164230/extras/7882bedf55e6e7ca36a2c43a2deaba91.webm?t=1770287610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164230/extras/7882bedf55e6e7ca36a2c43a2deaba91.mp4?t=1770287610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as an inspector dispatched from a private military company to investigate </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Underdog Corp</i>, a derelict research facility long since consumed by illegal human experimentation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inside, you encounter test subjects enhanced with violent mechanical limbs\u2014and lose parts of your own body in the struggle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive, you rip their prosthetics from their corpses and graft them onto yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each replacement makes you stronger\u2026 but less human.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remain human\u2014or become what you fear. The decision is in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Intense Combat System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164230/extras/a0d3e6f236563b3655bd9025e7ab610e.poster.avif?t=1770287610\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164230/extras/a0d3e6f236563b3655bd9025e7ab610e.webm?t=1770287610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164230/extras/a0d3e6f236563b3655bd9025e7ab610e.mp4?t=1770287610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your so-called \u201cself-defense\u201d weapon can transform into both a precision firearm and a brutal baton.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deflect enemy strikes with perfectly-timed parries, then punish them with devastating counterattacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be more vicious</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164230/extras/a5a465106ae73f917331bcf03ba4c36c.poster.avif?t=1770287610\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164230/extras/a5a465106ae73f917331bcf03ba4c36c.webm?t=1770287610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164230/extras/a5a465106ae73f917331bcf03ba4c36c.mp4?t=1770287610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This brutal and unforgiving lab won\u2019t welcome an intruder like you. Yet, you must press on. Every time you face danger, you'll have to make crucial decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Grotesque 2.5D Vision</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164230/extras/1b18dcd0a8b700dbdc1f912b70e03756.poster.avif?t=1770287610\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164230/extras/1b18dcd0a8b700dbdc1f912b70e03756.webm?t=1770287610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164230/extras/1b18dcd0a8b700dbdc1f912b70e03756.mp4?t=1770287610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a bleak sci-fi horror world built from a fusion of gritty 3D models and pixel-style art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharp lighting and hand-crafted environments bring a haunting PS2-era aesthetic to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3164230?t=1770287610","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164230/e8ef8cd39280c0dd2f967a506e60701127e70d85/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770287610","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164230/b57b4eb229ed2bdc872e667850fe8a5bca9357aa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770287610","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164230/b57b4eb229ed2bdc872e667850fe8a5bca9357aa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770287610","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Photosensitivity, graphic violence, depiction of suicide, self-harm, dismemberment, vomit, gore, blood, and death. \r\n"},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Die, over and over.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164230/extras/7882bedf55e6e7ca36a2c43a2deaba91.poster.avif?t=1770287610\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"h