 and a brutal baton.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deflect enemy strikes with perfectly-timed parries, then punish them with devastating counterattacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be more vicious</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164230/extras/a5a465106ae73f917331bcf03ba4c36c.poster.avif?t=1770287610\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164230/extras/a5a465106ae73f917331bcf03ba4c36c.webm?t=1770287610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164230/extras/a5a465106ae73f917331bcf03ba4c36c.mp4?t=1770287610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This brutal and unforgiving lab won\u2019t welcome an intruder like you. Yet, you must press on. Every time you face danger, you'll have to make crucial decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Grotesque 2.5D Vision</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164230/extras/1b18dcd0a8b700dbdc1f912b70e03756.poster.avif?t=1770287610\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164230/extras/1b18dcd0a8b700dbdc1f912b70e03756.webm?t=1770287610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164230/extras/1b18dcd0a8b700dbdc1f912b70e03756.mp4?t=1770287610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a bleak sci-fi horror world built from a fusion of gritt